      <title>AWS re:Invent 2025　AI 時代基礎設施大變革　Peter DeSantis：雲端「基本功」比以往更重要</title>
      <link>https://unwire.hk/2025/12/10/aws-reinvent-2025-peter-desantis-infrastructure-keynote/genai-and-cloud/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=aws-reinvent-2025-peter-desantis-infrastructure-keynote</link>
      <description>AWS re:Invent 2025 於拉斯維加斯踏入倒數第二日，AWS 公用運算高級副總裁 Peter DeSantis 以〈基礎設施創新〉為題發表演講，強調 AI 急速發展未改變雲端運算核心特質，反而令「安全性、可用性、彈性、成本與敏捷性」較以往更重要。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://unwire.hk/2025/12/10/aws-reinvent-2025-peter-desantis-infrastructure-keynote/genai-and-cloud/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=aws-reinvent-2025-peter-desantis-infrastructure-keynote</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://cdn.unwire.hk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/peter02-694x390.jpg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
      <pubDate>Wed, 10 Dec 2025 00:00:32 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
