      <title>Werner Out 但 Builders 傳奇才剛開始　re:Invent 2025 Dr. Werner 告別演說重點</title>
      <link>https://unwire.hk/2025/12/10/werner-out-werner-out/genai-and-cloud/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=werner-out-werner-out</link>
      <description>這是關於「告別」的演說，也是時代啟幕。Amazon.com 副總裁兼 CTO Dr. Werner Vogels 在 AWS re:Invent 2025 主題舞台上，以簡潔一句「Werner out.」結束 14 年來的年度壓軸演講，為雲端世代畫下圓滿句號。正如他常提醒開發者：「Everything fails, all the time.」失效是正常過程，重建才是開發者文化核心。Werner 離場並非結束，而是重啟。</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://unwire.hk/2025/12/10/werner-out-werner-out/genai-and-cloud/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=werner-out-werner-out</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://cdn.unwire.hk/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/picture1-1-694x391.png" length="0" type="image/png"/>
      <pubDate>Wed, 10 Dec 2025 03:49:30 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
